OL,3,GNEWSASwimmer Archie Goodburn to meet
OL,4,Aprime minister over cancer funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwimmer Archie Goodburn is to meet the
OL,7,Fprime minister later after making a
OL,8,Ftearful plea for more investment to be
OL,9,Fput into brain cancer research.
OL,11,FThe Scottish athlete, who was diagnosed
OL,12,Fwith three inoperable brain tumours two
OL,13,Fyears ago, said the Downing Street
OL,14,Fmeeting offered a "unique opportunity
OL,15,Ffor change".
OL,17,FHe previously called for Andy Burnham
OL,18,Fto introduce a brain cancer lead to
OL,19,Fgive patients a chance to "fight for
OL,20,Ftheir lives" during an appearance on
OL,21,FBBC Breakfast.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
