OL,3,GNEWSASwimmer Archie Goodburn to meet
OL,4,Aprime minister over cancer funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoodburn, 25, cried while looking down
OL,7,Fthe camera, saying he was "on my knees
OL,8,Fbegging" for help to ease the
OL,9,F"unbearable suffering" of patients and
OL,10,Ftheir families.
